WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:10.666
oh Hermione.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.700
didn't you say you were going home for Christmas?

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.300
you must have got it wrong, ron!

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:17.300
uh, would you like to go to the ball with me?

00:00:22.366 --> 00:00:23.900
what's her problem?

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.633
enjoy your date with Potter?

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.533
mind your own business!

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.900
does Potter know your father's a death eater?

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.500
tell him you can't go to the ball tomorrow.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.433
who are you to tell me what to do?

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.066
do you fancy him?

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:51.200
it's more than that. we're practically family.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.033
Potter and I are together now.

00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:02.400
what are you doing!?

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.100
protecting Harry.

00:01:08.566 --> 00:01:11.266
just like I protected you from that snake.

00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:13.033
you filthy mudblood!

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.500
white doesn't suit you. you snake.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.933
tell Potter you can't go tomorrow.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.133
or I'll tell him what your father is.

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:38.833
Fred!

00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:40.433
yes professor.

00:01:40.933 --> 00:01:43.066
know who Harry's taking to the ball tomorrow?

00:01:43.966 --> 00:01:45.233
Malfoy, is it?

00:01:45.233 --> 00:01:46.400
oh I reckon so.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.633
they looked pretty happy in Village High Street today.

00:01:50.566 --> 00:01:51.933
just as I planned.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.466
Harry, I need to talk to you.

